    {
      "id": "h:2a5502b81b6e",
      "kind": "quran",
      "ar": "وَمَا تَوْفِيقِىٓ إِلَّا بِٱللَّهِ",
      "tr": "He said, \"O my people, have you considered: if I am upon clear evidence from my Lord and He has provided me with a good provision from Him...?[573] And I do not intend to differ from you in that which I have forbidden you; I only intend reform as much as I am able. And my success is not but through Allāh. Upon Him I have relied, and to Him I return.[574]",
      "translit": "",
      "tag": "published",
      "src": {
