    {
      "id": "h:54011ae117c4",
      "kind": "quran",
      "ar": "حَسْبُنَا ٱللَّهُ وَنِعْمَ ٱلْوَكِيلُ",
      "tr": "Those to whom people [i.e., hypocrites] said, \"Indeed, the people have gathered against you, so fear them.\" But it [merely] increased them in faith, and they said, \"Sufficient for us is Allāh, and [He is] the best Disposer of affairs.\"[150]",
