    {
      "id": "h:f201c0fc36ce",
      "kind": "quran",
      "ar": "إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ",
      "tr": "The lightning almost snatches away their sight. Every time it lights [the way] for them, they walk therein; but when darkness comes over them, they stand [still]. And if Allāh had willed, He could have taken away their hearing and their sight. Indeed, Allāh is over all things competent.",
      "translit": "",
      "tag": "published",
      "src": {
