        "ref": "2:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h:70bd7bb2f321",
      "kind": "quran",
      "ar": "وَلَا تَهِنُوا۟ وَلَا تَحْزَنُوا۟ وَأَنتُمُ ٱلْأَعْلَوْنَ",
      "tr": "So do not weaken and do not grieve, and you will be superior if you are [true] believers.",
