    {
      "id": "h:b7c0ec44535e",
      "kind": "quran",
      "ar": "إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ",
      "tr": "He has only forbidden to you dead animals,[60] blood, the flesh of swine, and that which has been dedicated to other than Allāh. But whoever is forced [by necessity], neither desiring [it] nor transgressing [its limit], there is no sin upon him. Indeed, Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.",
      "translit": "",
      "tag": "published",
      "src": {
