    },
    {
      "id": "h:607185ca982d",
      "kind": "quran",
      "ar": "وَٱسْتَعِينُوا۟ بِٱلصَّبْرِ وَٱلصَّلَوٰةِ",
      "tr": "And seek help through patience and prayer; and indeed, it is difficult except for the humbly submissive [to Allāh]",
