    },
    {
      "id": "h:e021862d9629",
      "kind": "quran",
      "ar": "رَبَّنَآ ءَاتِنَا فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً",
      "tr": "But among them is he who says, \"Our Lord, give us in this world [that which is] good and in the Hereafter [that which is] good and protect us from the punishment of the Fire.\"",
      "translit": "",
      "tag": "published",
      "src": {
