    {
      "id": "h:cead4b7f3215",
      "kind": "quran",
      "ar": "وَٱللَّهُ يُحِبُّ ٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ",
      "tr": "And how many a prophet [fought in battle and] with him fought many religious scholars. But they never lost assurance due to what afflicted them in the cause of Allāh, nor did they weaken or submit. And Allāh loves the steadfast.",
      "translit": "",
      "tag": "published",
      "src": {
        "name": "English Translation - Noor International Center",
        "url": "https://quranenc.com/en/browse/english_saheeh",
